# Stray editor/backup copies. This repo deploys, and src/pages/blog/**/*.tsx
# is auto-discovered by import.meta.glob in BlogPage.tsx — a backup file that
# kept a clean .tsx name would be built and listed on /blog as a real article.
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.orig
*~

